# macOS
.DS_Store

# Rust build artifacts
/target/

# Compiled driver WASMs and packaged artifacts (build outputs — uploaded to GitHub Releases)
**/*.wasm
**/*.mur.zip

# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# Runtime output directories produced by mur run / test invocations
**/checkpoints/
**/workdir/
.nexus/

# tool-code-graph on-disk graph db + slice payloads — created under a target
# repo's .murmur/ at index/slice time; a runtime artifact, never committed.
**/.murmur/

# Host-test fixture trees. The file tools refuse absolute path inputs, so their host tests
# address fixtures relative to the crate root instead of under /tmp; a runtime artifact of
# `cargo test`, never committed.
**/.test-scratch/
